      "created_at": "2016-03-08T15:31:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was in the same boat; when I started, I didn't realize GTG was releasing an all hero variant pack, and by the time I did, I had most of them, and the inner completionist said \"Eh, screw it, let's go for broke.\" Just got the trade in for the last one I needed (YL) this week.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've ended up with a few extras</p><p>- Cosmic Omnitron</p><p>- Redeemer Fanatic</p><p>- Freedom Six (This'll be the hardest one to trade out, just fair warning now)</p><p>- Prime Wardens + KNYFE: Rogue Agent</p><p>- Termi-Nation + Santa Guise</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PM if interested; I'm interested in random Sentinels memorabilia, and willing to at least hear all offers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
